<title>UK: Sky TV says UK parliament to be dissolved April 8.</title>
<headline>Sky TV says UK parliament to be dissolved April 8.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sky Television reported that Britain's parliament would be dissolved on April 8 ahead of an election expected to be called for May 1.</p>
<p>Prime Minister John Major was expected to announce the election date at around 1230 GMT after returning to his Downing Street residence from an audience with head of state Queen Eliabeth.</p>
</text>
